# An activated ability's text is fixed as it is activated (CR 602.2) and the ability exists independently of its source
# (CR 113.7a): a text-changing effect on the source afterwards changes the source's text (CR 612.1), not the ability's.
# Bot1 activates Jace, Reality Sculptor's +1 ("Empower Jace X, where X is the number of Islands you control") with one
# Island, and in response Magical Hack replaces Island with Swamp in Jace's text. The +1 resolves counting Islands: the Jace
# token is made with 1 loyalty (counting Swamps it would have 0 and die, CR 704.5i). Jace's own text says Swamp from then on:
# on turn 3, with two Islands and no Swamp, the next +1 counts Swamps and puts nothing on the token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Jace, Reality Sculptor
Magical Hack
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

